{"said":"aura-2-hyperion-en\nIf you want a local language model or embeddings in Java, there are options. They work, though they're often slower than they should be. [pause] But what if you want to flag a fracture on an X-ray for review? Spot defects on a production line? Read a stack of invoices? Isolate the vocals from a track? Or any of a plethora of other capabilities? [pause] Until now, from the JVM, you were stuck. It meant a Python stack, or a tool like Comfy U.I. behind HTTP: another runtime, another process, and a network hop on every call. Kiln calls the native engines directly. No Python, no server, nothing in between.","words":[{"word":"if","start":0.24,"end":0.48},{"word":"you","start":0.48,"end":0.64},{"word":"want","start":0.64,"end":0.79999995},{"word":"a","start":0.79999995,"end":0.96},{"word":"local","start":0.96,"end":1.1999999},{"word":"language","start":1.1999999,"end":1.52},{"word":"model","start":1.52,"end":1.92},{"word":"or","start":1.92,"end":2.08},{"word":"embeddings","start":2.08,"end":2.56},{"word":"in","start":2.56,"end":2.72},{"word":"java","start":2.72,"end":3.4399998},{"word":"there","start":3.6,"end":3.84},{"word":"are","start":3.84,"end":4},{"word":"options","start":4,"end":4.7200003},{"word":"they","start":4.96,"end":5.2},{"word":"work","start":5.2,"end":5.92},{"word":"though","start":6,"end":6.16},{"word":"they're","start":6.16,"end":6.48},{"word":"often","start":6.48,"end":6.72},{"word":"slower","start":6.72,"end":7.12},{"word":"than","start":7.12,"end":7.2799997},{"word":"they","start":7.2799997,"end":7.44},{"word":"should","start":7.44,"end":7.68},{"word":"be","start":7.68,"end":8.24},{"word":"but","start":8.96,"end":9.2},{"word":"what","start":9.2,"end":9.36},{"word":"if","start":9.36,"end":9.44},{"word":"you","start":9.44,"end":9.599999},{"word":"want","start":9.599999,"end":9.679999},{"word":"to","start":9.679999,"end":9.76},{"word":"flag","start":9.76,"end":10.08},{"word":"a","start":10.08,"end":10.24},{"word":"fracture","s